sequenceDiagram
  actor user as "New User<br/>[Person]"
  box rgba(17,104,189,0.12) Cinema System (Software System boundary)
    participant ui as "Frontend App<br/>[Container: TypeScript]"
    participant api as "Backend API<br/>[Container: Spring Boot]"
  end
  user->>ui: Navigates to account creation page
  ui-->>user: Displays registration form
  user->>ui: Enters name, surname, age and presses Register
  alt valid input
    ui->>ui: Validates fields client-side
    ui->>api: Submits registration data
    api-->>ui: Returns success response
    ui-->>user: Confirms account created
  else invalid or missing fields
    ui->>ui: Validates fields client-side
    ui-->>user: Indicates invalid or missing fields
  end
